0..79 Comment "// The Lucas–Lehmer test shows that thirty-one, two to the fifth less one, is"
80..89 Comment "// prime."
90..92 Comment "//"
93..172 Comment "// Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire decide a Mersenne number\'s primality by the"
173..254 Comment "// Lucas–Lehmer test. Its squares and remainders allocate large unary naturals."
255..257 Comment "//"
258..333 Comment "// From four, the test squares, subtracts two and takes the remainder three"
334..414 Comment "// times. At one hundred and twenty-seven the run outlasts the conversion\'s step"
415..425 Comment "// budget."
426..428 Comment "//"
429..507 Comment "// - see: Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire, _Full Reduction at Full Throttle_,"
508..541 Comment "//   CPP 2011, § 4, Lucas-Lehmer"
542..579 Comment "// - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
581..622 Comment "// The free naturals and the numeral two."
